# RenoGo — Complete Architectural & Learning Guide (`learning.readme`)

Welcome to the definitive learning guide and technical breakdown for **RenoGo** — an enterprise Fleet Order & Supply Chain Management portal built for Renault.

This document covers **every folder and file in the project**, detailing its purpose, internal mechanics, React concepts, and every **callback function** and event mechanism used.

