## 10. Application Entry & Core Routing (`src/`)

### `src/main.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: React application entry point.
- **Mechanisms**: Locates `<div id="root">` via `document.getElementById("root")!` and creates the React 19 root via `createRoot(...).render(<App />)` wrapped in `<StrictMode>`.

### `src/App.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Defines the application routing tree using React Router DOM.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - `BrowserRouter as Router`: Wraps route context.
  - `AnimatedRoutes`: Uses `useLocation()` to supply a distinct `key={`${location.pathname}${location.search}`}` to trigger CSS route transitions.
  - **Nested Route Structure**:
    - The `/dealer` route mounts `<DealerPortal />` with nested child routes:
      - `index` redirects to `dashboard`
      - `dashboard` -> `<DashboardHome />`
      - `catalog` -> `<DealerVehicleCatalog />`
      - `my-requests` -> `<MyRequests />`
      - `profile` -> `<DealerProfile />`
    - Top-level routes for `/admindb`, `/usermg`, `/dealers`, `/vehiclecatalog`, `/manufacturer/*`, `/supervisor/*`, `/salesmanager/*`, and `/dealermanager/*`.

### `src/App.css` & `src/index.css`
- **Need / Purpose**:
  - `index.css`: Global typography (Inter, system-ui), CSS variables, base colors, reset rules.
  - `App.css`: Route transition keyframe animations (`fadeIn`, `slideUp`), shared card elevation, and layout utility classes.

---

## 11. Pages & Portals Deep Dive (`src/pages/`)

### 11.1 Login (`src/pages/Login/`)
- **`index.tsx` & `Login.css`**: Renders the login page hero container, background image, branding header, and mounts `<UserLoginForm />`.

---

### 11.2 Admin Dashboard (`src/pages/AdminDashBoard/`)

#### `Dashboard/index.tsx` & `Dashboard.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Main administrator overview.
- **Mechanisms**: Displays top-level KPI cards (Total Orders: 1,248, Total Dealers: 86, Total Revenue: $48,920) and embeds `<RequestStatus />` and `<AvailableModels />`.

#### `Dealers/index.tsx` & `Dealers.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Dealer management screen. Lists registered dealerships, total order volume, and status.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Parallel data fetching: `Promise.all([getDealers(), getOrders()])`.
  - Groups orders by dealer using `orders.reduce(...)`.
  - Can open `<DealerForm />` for creating dealerships, or open modal workflow views for Details / Approval.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `handleAddDealer`: Invokes `createDealer(dealer)` API and updates state with `setDealerList((prev) => [...prev, newDealer])`.
  - `onClick={() => openWorkflowView("details", dealer.id)}`.
  - `onClick={() => openWorkflowView("approval", dealer.id)}`.

#### `Dealers/DealersDetails/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Comprehensive profile of a dealership and their primary order context.
- **Mechanisms**: Reads route param `useParams()` or component props. Utilizes `useDealer(dealerId)` and `useOrder(dealerId, orderId)`.

#### `Dealers/ApprovalProduction/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Full lifecycle workflow tracker (Dealer Request -> Finance Approval -> Production Review -> Manufacturing -> Logistics -> Delivery).
- **Mechanisms**: Renders approval tracker badges and an audit trail history table.

#### `UserManagement/index.tsx` & `UserManagement.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Admin screen to create, edit, filter, and delete system users across all roles.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - State initialization callback from `localStorage`: `useState<User[]>(loadUsers)`.
  - Synchronizes changes to `localStorage` via `useEffect`.
  - Multi-condition filtering by text search query and role dropdown.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `handleSaveUser`: Upserts user via `map(...)` if editing or array spread `[...prev, user]` if creating.
  - `handleDeleteUser`: Filters out user ID via `filter((u) => u.id !== id)`.

#### `VehicleCatalog/index.tsx` & `VehicleCatalog.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Admin vehicle inventory catalog.
- **Mechanisms**: Fetches `/api/vehicle.json`, provides multi-faceted filtering (Model, Variant, Color, Availability).

---

### 11.3 Dealer Portal (`src/pages/Dealer/`)

#### `index.tsx`, `Dealer.css` & `utils.ts`
- **Need / Purpose**: Master layout shell for the Dealer portal.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Manages dealer identity (`dealerId`, `dealerName`, `dealerLocation`) resolved from `location.state` or `localStorage`.
  - Manages orders state seeded with `SEED_ORDERS` and merged with live `/api/orders` responses.
  - Exposes `OutletContext` (`DealerOutletContext`) to all nested routes:
    `{ dealerName, dealerId, dealerLocation, orders, openRequest, onViewOrder }`.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `handleOrderSubmitted`: Adds new order to top of list `[order, ...prev]`, closes request dialog, triggers a 6-second banner toast notification with `setTimeout`.

#### `DashBoard/index.tsx`, `DashBoard.css` & `types.ts`
- **Need / Purpose**: Dealer home dashboard.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Consumes parent context via `useOutletContext<DealerOutletContext>()`.
  - Derives statistics (`deriveStats(orders)`) for Pending, Approved, and Rejected orders.
  - Quick action buttons to open request dialog, view catalog, or check requests.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `onClick={() => openRequest(POPULAR_MODELS[0].name)}`.
  - `onClick={() => onViewOrder(order)}` opens slide-out order drawer.

#### `CreateRequest/index.tsx` & `CreateRequest.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Modal dialog for dealers to submit new vehicle fleet orders.
- **Mechanisms**: Controlled form for vehicle model, quantity, requested ETA, and remarks.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `handleSubmit`: Form submission callback calling `createOrder(...)`, creating a new order object with `Date.now()`, and triggering `onSubmitted(newOrder)`.
  - `onClose`: Dialog dismissal callback.

#### `MyRequests/index.tsx` & `MyRequests.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: List of all requests raised by the logged-in dealer with status tracking badges and quick search.
- **Callbacks**: `onClick={() => onViewOrder(o)}` callback to inspect order details.

#### `VehicleCatalog/index.tsx` & `VehicleCatalog.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Dealership model browser displaying high-res imagery, starting prices, engine specs, and "Request Fleet Order" buttons.

#### `Profile/index.tsx` & `Profile.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Displays authorized dealer credentials, GSTIN ID, primary contact email, and quarterly allocation quotas.

---

### 11.4 Dealer Manager Portal (`src/pages/DealerManager/`)

#### `DashBoard/index.tsx` & `DealerManager.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Operational dashboard for Dealer Managers.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Fetches requests via `getDmRequests()`.
  - Computes KPIs dynamically via `useMemo` based on request statuses.
- **Sub-Components**:
  - `KpiCards.tsx`: Displays summary cards.
  - `OverviewChart.tsx`: Renders MUI `@mui/x-charts/BarChart` with daily trend metrics.
  - `NotificationsCard.tsx`: Displays activity notifications list.

#### `Approvals/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Filterable approvals and requests screen with status tabs (`All`, `Awaiting Acknowledgement`, `Ready for Payment`, `Payment Submitted`, `Completed`).
- **Callbacks**:
  - `onChange={(e, val) => setSelectedTab(val)}`: MUI Tab switch callback.
  - `onChange={(e) => setSearchQuery(e.target.value)}`: Search field input callback.

#### `components/RecentRequestsTable.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Interactive table showing orders, quotation amounts, statuses, and payment states.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `onClick={() => handleOpenDetails(req)}`: Opens modal.
  - `onClick={() => navigate("/dealermanager/requests")}`: View all navigation.

#### `components/RequestDetailsModal/RequestDetailsModal.tsx` & Sub-components
- **Need / Purpose**: Comprehensive dialog for a Dealer Manager to review and action an order.
- **Modular Sub-components**:
  - `ModalHeaderBanner.tsx`: Shows vehicle model, request ID, dealer name, and close button.
  - `ModalMetricCards.tsx`: Displays unit count, unit base price, and advance deposit.
  - `RequestStatusStepper.tsx`: Step progress tracker (Quotation Generated -> Acknowledged -> Ready for Payment -> Payment Verified).
  - `RequestSummarySection.tsx`: Detailed tabular breakdown of order specifications.
  - `ManufacturerBankDetails.tsx`: Displays bank beneficiary, account number, IFSC code, and branch.
  - `FinalQuotationSection.tsx`: Financial summary card showing total cost, tax, advance due, and download quote action.
  - `RecentActivitySection.tsx`: Chronological audit log of timestamps and status changes.
  - `ManagerActionsBar.tsx`:
    - **Callbacks**:
      - `onAcknowledge`: Callback updating acknowledgment state.
      - "Upload Proof" file trigger callback.
      - "Proceed to Payment" action callback.

---

### 11.5 Manufacturer Portal (`src/pages/Manufacturer/`)

#### `DashBoard/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Factory overview showing total fleet orders, units awaiting allocation, and model inventory levels.
- **Mechanisms**: Fetches `/api/manufacturer-dashboard.json`, renders `KpiCard` grid, `ModelCard` inventory scroll, and `<DealerRequestTable />`.

#### `DealerRequestReviewModal/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Stock allocation modal where factory managers split an incoming request between existing warehouse stock and factory manufacturing.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Syncs available units vs manufacturing units: `available + manufacturing = total requested quantity`.
  - Attaches keyboard listener for `Escape` key in `useEffect` and cleans it up.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `updateAvailable(val)`: Updates available count and adjusts manufacturing count automatically.
  - `updateManufacturing(val)`: Adjusts manufacturing count and available count.
  - `onClose()`: Modal dismiss callback.

#### `Stocks/index.tsx`, `Stocks.css` & `types.ts`
- **Need / Purpose**: Factory inventory management portal.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Groups flat stock items into structured vehicle models with color breakdown.
  - Filter by category, fuel type, transmission, and availability.
- **Sub-Dialogs**:
  - `AddVehicleDialog/index.tsx`: Controlled dialog to add new vehicle stock.
    - **Callbacks**: `onSubmit`, `onNameChange`, `onVariantChange`, `onColorChange`, `onQuantityChange`, `onImageChange`.
  - `StockDetailsDialog/index.tsx`: Dialog to view breakdown by color, edit total quantity, or delete stock.
    - **Callbacks**: `onEdit`, `onDelete`, `onSave`, `onEditNameChange`, `onEditQuantityChange`, `onCancelEdit`.

#### `ViewRequests/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Dedicated full-page view of all incoming dealer requests for the manufacturer.

---

### 11.6 Supervisor Portal (`src/pages/Supervisor/`)

#### `Dashboard/index.tsx` & `Dashboard.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Supervisor dashboard tracking pending allocations and approved requests.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Fetches `/api/orders` and `/api/manufacturer-dashboard.json`.
  - Filters out unallocated requests.
  - Uses `useMemo` to compute pending, approved, and confirmed order counters.

#### `ViewRequests/index.tsx` & `ViewRequests.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Screen for supervisors to view allocated dealer requests and open the quotation review editor.
- **Mechanisms**: Cross-references orders, manufacturer allocations, and vehicle stock.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `openRequest(order)`: Asynchronously loads quotation via `getQuotationByOrderId(order.id)` and opens `<ReviewQuotation />`.

#### `ViewRequests/Review&Quotation/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Interactive quotation builder and financial verification screen.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Computes base total (`basePrice * quantity`), GST tax amount, total quotation sum, and required advance payment percentage.
  - Renders `<AvailabilityProgressBar />` for allocated stock percentage.
  - Allows in-place editing of Manufacturer Bank Details.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `saveBankDetails`: Invokes `updateQuotation(...)` API to persist updated bank details and calls parent `onQuotationChange(updatedQuote)`.
  - `onClose`: Closes review panel.

---

### 11.7 Sales Manager Portal (`src/pages/SalesManager/`)

#### `Dashboard/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Sales management dashboard to review finalized supervisor quotations and grant executive approval.
- **Mechanisms**:
  - Loads orders and manufacturer allocation data.
  - Clicking "Review" opens `<SalesManagerReviewModal />`.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `handleReviewAction(action)`: Updates local order status (`Approved` or `Declined`) upon approval or decline.

#### `Dashboard/SalesManagerReviewModal/index.tsx` & `SalesManagerReviewModal.css`
- **Need / Purpose**: Modal dialog presenting full dealer details, stock allocation progress bar, pricing breakdown, and decision buttons.
- **Mechanisms**: Includes conditional textarea for "Decline Reason" when declining a request.
- **Callbacks**:
  - `onChange={(e) => setNote(e.target.value)}`: Note text input callback.
  - `onChange={(e) => setDeclineReason(e.target.value)}`: Decline reason callback.
  - `onClick={() => onAction("Approved")}`: Approval action callback.
  - `onClick={() => onAction("Declined")}`: Decline action callback.

#### `Verification&Approval/index.tsx`
- **Need / Purpose**: Dedicated placeholder view for standalone sales verification workflows.

