## 12. Public & Static Assets

- `public/favicon.svg`: SVG icon for browser tabs.
- `public/icons.svg`: SVG icon sprite definitions.
- `src/assets/logo.png`: RenoGo brand logo.
- `src/assets/hero.png`, `bg1.webp`, `sb.png`, `sidebar_bg.png`: Layout backgrounds and decorative elements.
- `src/assets/*.jpg` / `*.png` (`clio.jpg`, `etech.jpg`, `megane.jpg`, `rafale.png`, `twingo.jpg`, `zoe.jpg`): High-resolution model imagery for vehicles.
- `src/assets/dealer/*` (`duster.jpg`, `fleet_promo.jpg`, `hero_banner.jpg`, `kiger.jpg`, `kwid.jpg`, `triber.jpg`): Marketing banners and vehicle catalog photography for the Dealer Portal.

